config BR2_PACKAGE_STEAM_DEVICES
	bool "steam-devices"
	help
	  Valve's udev rules giving the logged-in user access to game
	  controllers (Steam Controller/Deck, PlayStation, Xbox,
	  Nintendo, 8BitDo, …), VR headsets (Index, Vive) and
	  /dev/uinput, which Steam Input uses to present them as
	  virtual pads. Steam as a Flatpak cannot install these itself.

	  https://github.com/ValveSoftware/steam-devices
